	//[user 2026-08-17] Mauser C96 and Johnson M1941 (East). The two _unlock lines are what make
	//the guns earnable - their reward IS the weapon. Both hang off an aggregate stat that is
	//already written and sit one tier above the current top (headshot 25/100, longshot 25/75),
	//so they extend the ladder instead of duplicating a rung. The C96 is gated on headshots
	//because it is a precision sidearm; the Johnson on long shots because it is a .30-06 rifle.
	//[user 2026-08-23, bug-2080] ARMORY GLOVES - three specific, named challenges, so the loadout
	//unlock condition can say exactly what to do instead of "via challenges/ranks" (bug-2078).
	//All three stats are proven writers (check_challenges.py reports 0 dead stats).
	waitthread chal_def "glv_wool_unlock" "combat" "Frozen Fingers" "Get 150 kills in snow to unlock the Wool Knit Gloves" "kill_snow" 150 "glv_wool"
	waitthread chal_def "glv_mittens_unlock" "fireteam" "Steady Hands" "Finish 5 missions without dying to unlock the Wool Mittens" "nodeath" 5 "glv_mittens"
	waitthread chal_def "wpn_c96_unlock" "pistols" "Broomhandle" "Get 150 headshots to unlock the Mauser C96" "headshot" 150 "models/weapons/mauser_c96.tik"
