	// [user 08-06] bug-1505 - three e2l3 finale feats, all keyed off the SAME core action: destroy
	// the tank in FinalHouse/introhouse.scr before it exhausts its 6 scripted tankfire_target hits.
	// If the tank never lands a hit, the farmhouse is untouched (level.e2l3_farmhouseHit never gets
	// set - introhouse.scr's StartTankThinkThread) AND Lyndon survives (his death is unconditionally
	// tied to the tank reaching its 6th target, introhouse.scr:547-550 - kill the tank before then
	// and that branch never runs). Johnson/Hudson are a separate, independent survival check.
	waitthread chal_def "cc_not_one_stone"  "vehicles" "Not One Stone"                           "Destroy the tank before it lands a single hit on the farmhouse"          "cc_not_one_stone"  1 ""
