	// ============ AXIS FACTION TRACKING [user 2026-08-04] bug-1346 ============
	// stat fac_<x> bumped by chal_ai_killed via chal_factionOf: classifies the VICTIM MODEL
	// path by substring, most-specific pattern first, cached per model. Notes on mapping:
	//   Bersaglieri -> sc_ax_ital_para  and  Carabinieri -> it_ax_ital_vol: the trilogy ships
	//   no distinct models for either unit, so these are the closest real actors.
	//   Fallschirmjaeger -> the _fg (Fallschirm-gear) SS/heer variants, which is what the
	//   games actually use for airborne-equipped troops.
	//   Generals also count the coop OFFICER BOSS (hooked in officer.scr on his death).
	waitthread chal_def "fac_heer_1" "axis" "Frontline Sweeper" "Eliminate 50 Wehrmacht infantry" "fac_heer" 50 ""
